{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9a2ed7c0-8b2c-8f1e-95e1-5f57fcdcf60e",
  "created_at": "2026-02-12T12:50:03-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "David Almy",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:47:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:47:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. I'm calling about my trash. It didn't get picked up on the usual day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:47:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can help with that. Can you tell me the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:47:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "What's that? You'll have to speak up, I don't hear so well."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:47:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. What's the address where the trash wasn't picked up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:47:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "292 Gidley Street. That's in the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:47:34-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two ninety-two Gidley Street. Got it. And what's your usual pickup day there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:47:40-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, it's Tuesday. Sorry, I'm not sure, I think they told me Tuesday. Maybe Thursday. It's been a while since I looked at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:47:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right. We'll sort out which day it is. When did you put the barrel out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:47:57-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I put it out Tuesday night, and it was still sitting there this morning. Full. Nobody came by."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:48:05-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So you put it out Tuesday night, and as of this morning, Thursday, it hadn't been emptied."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:48:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Thursday, today. Still sitting at the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:48:17-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Now, were you also asking about the schedule? I want to make sure I've got what you need."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:48:25-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Wait, did you say Tuesday or Thursday? For the pickup, I mean. I missed that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:48:32-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I haven't said yet. I'm going to look up your street. Bear with me a moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:48:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, take your time. I'm not going anywhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:48:43-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. [pause] All right, I'm showing Thursday for the pickup on Gidley Street. So Thursday is your day, and the crew may still be on its route today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:48:54-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thursday? So I put it out a day early? Well, then it's sitting there on the right day now. Huh. But I'd still like someone to look into it. Can a supervisor call me back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:49:08-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I can put in a request for a supervisor to call you. Is the best number 401-555-0190?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:49:16-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Say that again? Slower, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:49:19-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-oh."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:49:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's the one. That's my cell. I keep it on loud, so I'll hear it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:49:28-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I'll note that it's 292 Gidley Street, the trash wasn't picked up, and you'd like a supervisor to call back. Anything else I should add?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:49:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I think that's it. Just have them call me and tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:49:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. In the meantime, leave the barrel at the curb in case the truck comes through this afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:49:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Leave it at the curb. Okay. Thank you, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:49:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Almy. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:50:01-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
